    "markdown": "![ACL Logo](https://aclanthology.org/images/acl-logo.svg) ACL Anthology ⟨1⟩\n  * About⟨2⟩\n    * Announcements⟨3⟩\n    * Communication channels⟨4⟩\n    * Related work⟨5⟩\n    * Copyright⟨6⟩\n    * * * *\n    * Credits⟨7⟩\n    * Volunteer⟨8⟩\n    * Development⟨9⟩\n    * Feedback⟨10⟩\n  * Using⟨2⟩\n    * Citing papers⟨11⟩\n    * Links in the Anthology⟨12⟩\n    * Data access⟨13⟩\n    * * * *\n    * All FAQs⟨14⟩\n    * * * *\n    * ###### Details\n    * Anthology identifiers⟨15⟩\n    * Names⟨16⟩\n    * ORCID iDs⟨17⟩\n    * DOIs⟨18⟩\n    * Verified authors⟨19⟩\n  * Contributions⟨2⟩\n    * Submissions⟨20⟩\n    * Corrections⟨21⟩\n    * Author pages⟨22⟩\n    * Attachments⟨23⟩\n  * GitHub⟨24⟩\n\n\n##  National Research Council ⟨22⟩\n* * *\n#### 2009\npdf ⟨25⟩bib ⟨26⟩\n**MT : the Current Research Landscape⟨27⟩**  \nRoland Kuhn⟨28⟩ | Pierre Isabelle⟨29⟩ | National Research Council⟨30⟩ | Canada⟨31⟩  \nProceedings of Machine Translation Summit XII: Plenaries⟨32⟩\nSearch⟨33⟩\n##### Co-authors\n  * Canada⟨31⟩ 1\n  * Pierre Isabelle⟨29⟩ 1\n  * Roland Kuhn⟨28⟩ 1\n\n\n##### Venues\n  * MTSummit⟨34⟩1\n\n\n Fix author⟨35⟩\n![Creative Commons License](https://i.creativecommons.org/l/by/4.0/88x31.png)⟨36⟩ ACL materials are Copyright © 1963–2026 ACL; other materials are copyrighted by their respective copyright holders. Materials prior to 2016 here are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 International License⟨37⟩. Permission is granted to make copies for the purposes of teaching and research. Materials published in or after 2016 are licensed on a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License⟨38⟩.\nThe ACL Anthology is managed and built by the ACL Anthology team⟨7⟩ of volunteers.\n_Site last built on 22 July 2026 at 14:46 UTC withcommit 280e4ed⟨39⟩._\n",
